{"id":"40c535e777364ba4","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion4-random-real.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Random Real","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-random-real — ZFC Recursion4 Random Real","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-random-real","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-random-real"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-random-real — ZFC Recursion4 Random Real","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-recursion4-martin-lof-test.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-random-real"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-random-real</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-random-real — ZFC Recursion4 Random Real"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"be9c2609f02de522\" href=\"?note=be9c2609f02de522\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-recursion4-martin-lof-test.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-recursion4-martin-lof-test.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4MartinLofTest}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4MartinLofTest}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"be9c2609f02de522\" href=\"?note=be9c2609f02de522\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-recursion4-martin-lof-test.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-recursion4-martin-lof-test.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4RandomReal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4RandomReal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}random\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4RandomReal}_S(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in2^\\omega\\land\\forall\\vec U\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4MartinLofTest}_S(\\vec U)\n\\to x\\notin\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec U(n)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}random\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4RandomReal}_S(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in2^\\omega\\land\\forall\\vec U\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4MartinLofTest}_S(\\vec U)\n\\to x\\notin\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec U(n)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A random real avoids the null intersection determined by every Martin-Löf test.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-recursion4-martin-lof-test.md","status":"resolved","id":"be9c2609f02de522","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-recursion4-martin-lof-test.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-recursion4-martin-lof-test.md","status":"resolved","id":"be9c2609f02de522","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4MartinLofTest}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-recursion4-martin-lof-test.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4MartinLofTest}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4RandomReal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}random\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4RandomReal}_S(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in2^\\omega\\land\\forall\\vec U\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4MartinLofTest}_S(\\vec U)\n\\to x\\notin\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec U(n)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":989,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3274","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion4-random-real.md|58-df-zfc-recursion4-random-real]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","be9c2609f02de522"]}